able.Clone ]` imports a group. A position that reaches\nREADME.md:47:standard containers as `std::vec::Vec`, `std::option::Option`,\nREADME.md:48:`std::result::Result`, and `std::boxed::Box`, so a declaration cannot\nREADME.md:71:One inline datom value, no flags; every reply is a value of the\nREADME.md:72:contract's `Response`. With no argument, `ethos-zero` prints its own\nREADME.md:78:test, fmt, clippy, doc, the no-free-functions and no-inherent-methods\nflake.nix:2:  description = \"ethos-zero — the ethos schema language, version zero\";\nflake.nix:18:    datom-codec = {\nflake.nix:19:      url = \"github:LiGoldragon/datom-codec/f2cc06858d38a4028c928d33323a6d682e7c222f\";\nflake.nix:26:  outputs = { self, nixpkgs, flake-utils, rust-build, protos, datom-codec }:\nflake.nix:69:              \"${protos}/protos.ethos\" \"${protos}/protos-kinds.ethos\"\nflake.nix:70:              \"${datom-codec}/datom-codec.ethos\" \"${datom-codec}/datom-codec-kinds.ethos\"\nflake.nix:80:          no-inherent-methods = pkgs.runCommand \"ethos-zero-no-inherent-methods\" { inherit src; } ''\nflake.nix:82:            ${builtins.readFile ./checks/no-inherent-methods.sh}\nchecks/no-free-functions.sh:1:# Every method call lives under a trait: no module-level free function in src,\nchecks/no-free-functions.sh:5:  echo \"production Rust must not use module-level free functions\" >&2\nfixtures/composition-types.ethos:1:Library\nCargo.toml:3:version      = \"6.1.6\"\nCargo.toml:5:rust-version = \"1.89\"\nCargo.toml:8:description  = \"Ethos schema language version zero: reads ethos, generates Rust.\"\nCargo.toml:23:default = [\"datom\"]\nCargo.toml:24:datom = []\nCargo.toml:28:datom-codec = { git = \"https://github.com/LiGoldragon/datom-codec\", rev = \"f2cc06858d38a4028c928d33323a6d682e7c222f\" }\nCargo.toml:31:syn         = { version = \"3\", features = [\"full\"] }\nCargo.toml:33:rkyv = { version = \"0.8\", default-features = false, features = [\"std\", \"bytecheck\", \"little_endian\", \"p